+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| initialization | madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::new,madraft/src/raft/state.rs::default | madraft/proof/progress.rs | Local state methods imported; constructor, membership/group identity and host caller composition unproved. |
+| transitions | madraft/src/raft/state.rs::adopt_term,madraft/src/raft/state.rs::campaign,madraft/src/raft/state.rs::grant_vote,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::tick,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::append,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::vote_reply,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::append_reply | madraft/proof/progress.rs | Only local term/vote bodies verified; log invariant, RPC provenance, finite bounds and all async callers remain open. |
+| outputs | madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::start,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::request_vote,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::apply,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::advance_commit,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::persist | madraft/proof/progress.rs | Persistence-before-send and exact emission/application observation relation unproved. |
+| recovery | madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::restore,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::persist | madraft/proof/progress.rs | Decode refinement, interrupted pair writes, error fail-stop behavior, history retention and post-recovery preconditions unproved. |
+| snapshots | madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::snapshot,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::cond_install_snapshot,madraft/src/raft/raft.rs::append,madraft/src/kvraft/server.rs::new | madraft/proof/progress.rs | Compacted prefix origin, decoder equivalence, application ordering and service caller contracts unproved. |
+<!-- /connections -->
+
+Next action: diagnose controller basic_4a timeout (including main-node networking), complete shard migration with stable group identity, then extend same-source verified consensus representation and construct implementation.rs with actual history/provenance/observations. All five fixed safety targets, execution link, nonempty witness, snapshot fidelity, full finite-counter proofs and conditional liveness remain OPEN. Existing runtime arithmetic and IO-error paths require review; no resource or disk consistency theorem has been established.
--- before/madraft/RESULT.md
+++ after/madraft/RESULT.md
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Result — incomplete round 1 candidate
+
+Raft 2A/2B/2C/2D implemented and all retained Raft tests passed on seeds 1, 2 and 3 at successive revisions; seeds 4 and 5 and a single-revision final sweep remain OPEN. KV 3A implemented and seed-1 tests passed; KV 3B implemented and final seed-1 family rerun passed all 19 KV tests after repairing actual size failures. Controller 4A implemented but two seed-1 family runs timed out in basic_4a; diagnosis remains OPEN. Sharded KV 4B remains unfinished. Original tests, requirements, licenses and checker were preserved.
+
+Election Safety, Leader Append-Only, Log Matching, Leader Completeness and State Machine Safety are all OPEN. There is no implementation.rs execution/observation adapter yet. The local progress proof checks executable term monotonicity, checked campaign increment, vote immutability within a term and rejection of two distinct candidates at one node in a term; it does not establish any global target. The safety command passed foundation, definitions and progress; all implementation-dependent goals remained OPEN because implementation.rs is absent. Progress Verus reported 7 verified and 0 errors.
+
+Execution coverage includes actual simulated elections, partitions, conflicting suffixes, concurrent proposals, unreliable RPC, crashes, snapshot compaction/transfer and restored application delivery in retained Raft tests. Formal coverage of actual constructors, host operations, sends, applications, crashes, recovery and snapshot decoding remains OPEN. Group identity is currently implicit in fixed peer endpoints and is not yet represented in a proven observation history. Conditional liveness and application correctness proofs remain OPEN.
+
+Host functions currently used include Endpoint::bind/add_rpc_handler/call_timeout, task::spawn, time::sleep/Instant::now, rand::thread_rng/gen_range/random, std and futures mutex operations, mpsc::unbounded/unbounded_send, fs::read/metadata/File::create/write_all_at/sync_all and serde/bincode serialization. These are unverified host boundaries under the supplied environment; no new trusted consensus body was introduced. FsSim completed writes survive node restart, power_fail is unfinished and sync_all is a no-op. The new two-generation-pair protocol has not been machine proved against all interruptions; no real-disk durability is claimed. Invalid membership fails at construction; durable decode failures refuse restart. Finite resource exhaustion and IO failure behavior still require complete fail-stop composition and proofs.
+
+Reproduce with python3 scripts/check.py build; python3 scripts/check.py test raft::tests:: --seed 3; python3 scripts/check.py test kvraft::tests:: --seed 1; python3 scripts/check.py test shard_ctrler::tests:: --seed 1; python3 scripts/check.py foundation; python3 scripts/check.py proof madraft/proof/progress.rs. Full acceptance still requires python3 scripts/check.py safety and python3 scripts/check.py final --timeout 3600 on one stopped candidate after unfinished dependencies are completed. See PROGRESS.md for the single connection table and next action.
